    "43 existing AMDGPU cases including new startup/VCN/display power helpers; no added global gate.",
    "26 Contract schema mutation checks; all previous layouts, versions and constants preserved.",
    "Existing common kernel telemetry case and8 Zig/C GUI facade cases; module builds passed.",
    "Explicit RLC/SMU acknowledgements, unsafe partial writes, late and negative replies retain ownership.",
    "DCN sleep polling finds cursor demand before any GC VM mapping or ring work; VCN session backing retained across stop/start."
